{"version":1,"key":"article:3","content":{"id":3,"title":"小球会停下来吗","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"457aae6d-3bd4-4ec5-bbe0-84a429323c88","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在高中的时候我有这么一个思考，灵感源于一道物理题目"}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"2e3a94cf-ab2f-4b14-ae1c-e67a2d0af9ce","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4d238912-2440-4e85-8ef2-beed151813dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个小球从高度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"h","collabId":"c1e397b5-1a26-4b37-85c4-488c4af47bf6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"h"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的地方下落，落在地面上接着弹起，但是由于与地面碰撞造成能量损失，使得每次弹起的高度只有之前高度的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1/4","collabId":"b9a7faf4-6f1f-432b-affb-b2461670731e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/4"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6cdca718-873a-48e0-99b6-4f6d59913a0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这道题目看起来是没有什么问题，当时我的想法是每次球的高度都会变为原来的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1/4","collabId":"3afbd020-b03c-41d0-8b2e-162893eb8f2e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/4"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以球是会一直这样弹下去的，就像是庄子说的"}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"91950347-5c6d-488d-8ce6-008ff72c8b03","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f2f56b0-3c61-4861-8eec-383d539b9059","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一尺之棰，日取其半，万世不竭。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ada771e4-d256-4e38-a7e0-56e8c7ff0406","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以在这里我得到一个结论，小球会一直运动下去，所以小球的运动时间为无穷大。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"94b9b5d4-983d-412f-886f-c06963cd5205","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是当我计算时却发现不对劲，假设从高度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"h","collabId":"aac27a7b-03b5-46f1-837d-5ce890d92cee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"h"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 降落所需的时间为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"t_0","collabId":"0679a9b5-2d28-4223-9ca3-d827a303f9fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"t_0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，由于下降所需时间 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"t \\propto \\sqrt{h}","collabId":"bbbcdb82-b7d2-464b-a0ae-27b4a07d134d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"t \\propto \\sqrt{h}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，那么 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"h/4","collabId":"e9eb5b8a-a780-49a9-a956-4e1a67c8af2e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"h/4"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 下降所需的时间为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"t_0/2","collabId":"23ae62a8-d37e-4099-ac82-8a0306f7440e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"t_0/2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，换句话说，每次上升然后下降所需的时间为之前所需时间的一半，所以耗费的时间的数列为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"t_0, \\frac{t_0}{2},  \\frac{t_0}{2^2},  \\cdots,  \\frac{t_0}{2^n}, \\cdots","collabId":"5c53a60b-2d53-4bb2-8a35-a8709f5d3b85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c8655b71-85fc-4dd2-81b4-9b092ed13cda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是一个等比数列，公比为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1/2","collabId":"b0e02fc3-b246-4c0d-9b7c-305594c25c7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们对这个数列求和"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"t_0 \\lim\\limits_{n \\to \\infty} \\sum_{t = 0}^{n} \\frac{1}{2^{i}} = 2t_0","collabId":"88c6761a-9934-45d3-92a4-cf3d399908b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"db2d1b5e-3dd6-42ac-a58b-fcf877e57a08","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们得到这么一个事实，小球的运动时间不会超过 $2t_0$，也就是说小球会在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2t_0","collabId":"8608e8af-f6a8-4518-90e1-8278588bec2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2t_0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后停下，这与我在之前得到的结论相反，小球应该会一直弹下去，怎么会停下来呢?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b9157ad3-2ab7-4b22-976c-e73c4bf5b1c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以我当时一直在苦恼，小球到底会"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"不会停下来？"},{"type":"formatted","text":" "}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8d2c4b23-a91a-4180-83d2-f0f84a46966c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我与身边的同学讨论过这个问题，但是显然他们不仅没有给我正确的答案，反而最后也有这个疑问。而且这个问题一直没有得到解答，渐渐的我也就忘了这个问题，毕竟这种问题不会再考卷上出现，也不会影响我的学习。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8fc4cfdb-d18e-4122-9965-ab063e745b87","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而现在我突然想起这个问题，是因为我最近在看一本书 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"《上帝掷骰子吗?：量子物理史话》"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这本书是讲量子力学的历史的，这本书给了我一个启发来解决我上面的疑惑。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ceeb861b-ff39-42e8-962f-1f6d3a1a1234","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想必在我们大部分的认知中，我们会觉得认为时间是连续的，空间是连续的，能量也是连续的。汽车速度从 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0\\text{km/h}","collabId":"f2583c4a-7583-480c-bf5d-19d896565cc3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0km/h"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 加速到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"100\\text{km/h}","collabId":"f7812121-6841-41b6-a0b7-8e37ad2fe979","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100km/h"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么速度一定会经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"25\\text{km/h}","collabId":"d50b2fe6-d704-469b-9547-adb54c7f8636","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"25km/h"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为速度它是连续变化的；温度从 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0^\\text{o}\\text{C}","collabId":"0f2f7039-8b18-4985-8dd4-c8867b9bd0ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0℃"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上升到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"100^\\text{o}\\text{C}","collabId":"f0cb970a-ed29-4eef-acdd-cd3b0d7183bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么它一定会经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"25^\\text{o}\\text{C}","collabId":"b12ddc4a-6455-4ddd-aa2b-6b19bb924f28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"25℃"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为温度也是连续变化的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5170e61-50be-4401-927f-6c127420ef78","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"量子力学的创始者普朗克在研究物理问题时，由于数学处理的需要，他假设能量它不是连续的，而是离散的，有着最小单位，而能量的大小只能为这些最小单位的整数倍。普朗克带来这么一种观念，能量是离散的，而不是连续的，这在当时简直就是异类学说，甚至在普朗克最初提出这么一个概念时，他自己都不相信。但是最后我们知道量子力学它是对的，能量并不是连续的，而是离散的，只是能量的最小单位非常小，察觉不出来而已。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"de92191b-a9ec-4514-bb54-c6be12b1db9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以这给我带来的启发就是，空间它是不是也是离散的，它是不是也有着最小的单位，只是这个单位特别小，我们察觉不出来而已。如果空间也有着最小的单位，那当我们的高度已经是最小单位时，它是不是就会停下来，因为它不可能达到最小单位的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1/4","collabId":"10989baa-64f8-4826-9a3c-05e0d037cbbf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/4"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为已经是最小了，如果比最小单位还小，那还能叫做最小单位吗。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"06ce8962-c162-4deb-8f22-af7726d2dfc3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以我的结论就是小球会停下来，它不会永远的弹下去，因为空间有最小单位。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0394f3e6-988d-47f4-b6a6-31d1d2fb89e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在这里我又想起了一个悖论，那就是芝洛悖论："}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"5e9afbf0-24c6-49eb-8dca-d480160404f8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"002b00ec-0e3e-4097-b650-eb5c5b7d9db2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个人和一只乌龟进行赛跑，乌龟的速度为 1m/s，人的速度为 10m/s，乌龟在人前方 100m，那么这个悖论说的是人永远追不上乌龟，只能无限的逼近乌龟，这是怎么回事？"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"431f3009-4b9e-47a1-be03-540a93422664","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设乌龟在点 B，人在点 A，人要追上乌龟就必须要经过 B 点"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/小球会停下来吗-第 1 页.drawio2022-04-23-10-32-46.svg","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/小球会停下来吗-第 1 页.drawio2022-04-23-10-32-46.svg","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"b32200f4-4add-44e3-9e85-3d0befe68985","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1e4b8ef6-e845-4360-a275-f3a62b9a92af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是当人到达 B 点时，乌龟已经到达 C 点了"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/小球会停下来吗-第 2 页.drawio2022-04-23-10-33-38.svg","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/小球会停下来吗-第 2 页.drawio2022-04-23-10-33-38.svg","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"fbc398a3-598e-4b7d-8c6c-6d7df7721d74","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"13e71824-7652-4354-85f6-89019000c37a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同理，人如果要追上乌龟的话，就必须会经过 C 点，而当人到达 C 点时，乌龟已经去了 D 点了，如此往复，人永远都不可能追上乌龟，只可能在无限的逼近。这与我们的实际不符，那么我们怎么来反对这么一个悖论?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"077059d0-f403-4e84-9734-ad6f89cf6707","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们假设时间和空间不是连续的，不能够永远的分割下去，它们都有着最小的单位，即时间和空间都是离散的。在这样的假设下，那么人就不会无限的逼近乌龟，所谓的无限的逼近乌龟，指的就是人与乌龟之间的距离无限的趋近于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0","collabId":"30f8b1ab-20ec-41bf-b790-6a8209d41ff2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是我们假设空间它不是连续的，即人与空间之间的距离不会无限的小，最小也只可能是一个空间最小单位。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b9cd5a73-8d5f-4b8d-9ae2-c5b93b54b63e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那什么时候人会超过乌龟呢? 我们不妨假设人在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1","collabId":"01416d35-3d18-45be-9bdb-b2ef4c4c88fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个时间最小单位中能够移动 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"10","collabId":"04466acb-d1c6-44ab-aaf1-78041f7ff72d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"10"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个空间最小单位，而乌龟在在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1","collabId":"0194eae1-2dfa-402f-ab76-e4f480e67911","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个时间最小单位中能够移动 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1","collabId":"27edc092-f5cc-4e9d-a462-d10be8b4333d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个空间最小单位，当人与乌龟之间的距离小于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"9","collabId":"8a711541-d30f-4a5e-98d6-ba50e03b335f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个空间最小单位时，那么在下一个时间最小单位，人就超过了乌龟。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c77440c8-5dce-4ee7-ab88-54c9613cc758","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以，我认为这个世界的本质不是连续的，而是离散的。"}]}],"tags":["世界观"],"bannerBg":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/wallhaven-j33p25_32ffaf42-3d49-4846-bf95-2a7850df7a5e.jpg","createTime":1598745600000,"updateTime":1777725168517},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1777725168517}}